* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
* Called by the kernel (op_coll.c, EXPAND()) to read the record that a link in
* a data collection names.  A link is "filename:id" (the filename is up to the
* first colon), or just "id" when a file variable was given to EXPAND().  This
* returns the record as READ gives it, which is a collection for a data
* collection file, and a null string if there is no such file or record.  The
* kernel decides whether what comes back can be used.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
*
* START-CODE

$internal
$no.symbols
$no.xref
$recursive

subroutine expand(file.name, id, fvar)

   if len(file.name) then
      open file.name to f else return value ''
   end else
      f = fvar
   end

   read rec from f, id else return value ''

   return value rec
end

* END-CODE
